      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Well, I have COPD, for two years. I did try to ignore it for a while. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help. I've had high blood pressure for nearly five years now. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite.",
